157
00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:56.300
So I reached out to Justin, and I asked him, where did the idea for this episode come from?

158
00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:59.260
And he said it was really simple.

159
00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:05.960
Greg really wanted to explore this idea of that feeling you get when you have to come back

160
00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.620
