00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.490
He did a dad mind trick.

201
00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:25.470
Oh, my gosh.

202
00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:27.110
He was like, yeah, I need it in three days.

203
00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:33.170
But also knowing that that way, Justin wouldn't like make it too precious and take too long

