You can find her on Instagram at hairferry.kim.

1435
01:14:03.060 --> 01:14:06.300
That's H-A-I-R-F-E-R-R-Y.kim.

1436
01:14:06.440 --> 01:14:11.500
She posts so many fun behind the scenes things from all the projects she's worked on, including

1437
01:14:11.500 --> 01:14:12.120
the office.

