I asked Kate, was there anything I could share?

1440
01:14:18.180 --> 01:14:22.040
And she said, will you tell them all that I'm just so tickled that Meredith Palmer has

1441
01:14:22.040 --> 01:14:22.680
a Funko Pop?

1442
01:14:25.540 --> 01:14:29.320
You can see what Kate's up to at the real Kate Flannery on Instagram.

1443
